 blocks](project_dcg-guard-blocks.md) — a Bash command was rejected outright; which shapes trip it and the rewrite that works\n49\t- [Headless tool-deny gap](project_headless-claude-tool-deny-gap.md) — `claude -p --disallowedTools Bash` still runs shell via context-mode MCP; before calling a headless run read-only\n50\t- [Config encoding damage from Windows](project_settings-json-bom-trap.md) — dcg cries \"hook missing\", or the statusline bars render as `â–“` junk; one bad write causes both, in settings.json AND CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md\n51\t- [Tech inventory refresh](project_tech-inventory-refresh.md) — which forms platform is live, why gws cannot pull responses, the stale OneDrive copy, reminder sent 9/8, the refresh command\n52\t- [Brain audit loop](project_brain-audit-loop.md) — scoring the second brain; why manual rituals die and cron ones live\n53\t- [Hook two-copies trap](project_hook-two-copies-trap.md) — a hook patch \"reverts\"; `.claude/hooks/` and `.codex/hooks/` both need it\n54\t- [Child dental plan](user_child-dental-plan.md) — 4yo cavities: pediatric dentist not yet booked, SDF vs n-HAp\n55\t- [ELI5 output style](user_eli5-output-style.md) — concise plain-language output rules shared by Claude Code and Codex\n56\t- [GitHub consolidation](project_github-consolidation.md) — ~/DEV on GitHub: the thin root repo, _ARCHIVE, where DexaProject went, merge traps\n57\t- [Skill bloat and promotion](project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md) — before touching ANY skill folder: which of the three copies is canonical, why `~/.claude/skills` IS a git repo, the sync script that deletes, the 2026-09-12 audit, the 40 name-only skills (9/14), Pi/pi.dev facts\n58\t- [Prioritization slate](project_prioritization-slate.md) — Eric proposes a new project or idea; the cap, charters, slate-check timer, clearing a nag with mark-done\n59\t- [Baylor department names](user_baylor-department-names.md) — Athletic Performance / Athletic Medicine / Applied Performance, never S&C / sports medi