search/` | Epilepsy + baseball literature review |\n| `TOS_Evidence_Brief/` | Thoracic outlet syndrome in overhead throwing athletes. One-page briefing note + 14-page evidence review, built to Word/PDF by `scripts/` → own `AGENTS.md` |\n| `BookInbox/` | Staging for books not yet ingested |\n| `reMarkale_extract/` | reMarkable highlight extraction. Note the spelling — \"reMarkale\". |\n| `ContextVault/` | Context storage experiment |\n| `May_Meetings_Research/` | May 2026 meeting materials and EOY research reporting. Disk is the source of truth → own `CLAUDE.md`. Dormant. |\n\n## Tooling that serves this area\n\n- Skills: `sports-science-research-grounding`, `library-advisor`,\n  `ingest-book`, `ingest-resource`, `pp-zotero-research-library`\n- CLIs: `zotero-research-library-pp-cli`, `zotero-research-library-pp-mcp`\n- MCP: `zotero` (the one server in local `~/.claude.json`)\n- Vault: `~/SecondBrain` holds 842 notes and has its own `CLAUDE.md`\n- Compiled knowledge: `~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler/knowledge/` (185 articles)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Search across everything with `memsearch search \"<query>\" --top-k 5`\n  rather than reading the knowledge index directly.\n- Zotero recall gotcha: `project_milvus-lock-misdiagnosis.md`.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":10,"oldLines":9,"newStart":10,"newLines":6,"lines":[" | `SportScienceResearchRepo/` | Main research repo. Has `CONTEXT.md`, a spec sheet, and an `index.html` micro-app → own `CLAUDE.md` |"," | `ZoteroInjestion/` | Zotero ingest pipeline (~1,850 files). Note the spelling — \"Injestion\", not \"Ingestion\". |"," | `LibraryProject/` | Book library → advisor entries → own `CLAUDE.md` |","-<<<<<<< HEAD","-| `Flint/` | Knowledge-ingest side-lane that feeds Flint, the sport-science thought partner: catalog, deep-ingest, per-discipline synthesis. Outside the slate cap → own `CLAUDE.md` |","-======="," | `Flint/` | Knowledge base behind Claude-as-\"Flint\", Eric's sport-science thought partner (side lane). Drive catalog, own-method baseline, triage, per-discipline synthesis. Plan in `docs/PLAN.md` → own `AGENTS.md` |"," >>>>>>> origin/main"," | `Weekly_Research_Review/` | \"Research in 5\": weekly one-paper review. Deck PDF for Teams, post, email, running index. Outputs on `_DRIVE/07_EDUCATION/Research_in_5` → own `AGENTS.md` |"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8fe4d1a7-bfcf-4ece-9a39-edb8c6fe9605","session_id":"02d4a48c-336d-4ffa-a0f7-cc20fd6681c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"02d4a48c-336d-4ffa-a0f7-cc20fd6681c5","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"main"}
