{"parentUuid":"5d33755b-4d45-4212-bce9-0ffd38dc714d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfVtQCX6c24ndmGtBSzas","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Sync done. Mac is clean.\n\n**First: old hook errors in the log.** These are from before today:\n- `daily-backup` said \"repo-behind-blocked\" for `global-memory`, `skills` and `SecondBrain`. Those repos were behind GitHub. This sync fixed `global-memory` and `skills`. I did not touch `SecondBrain`, because this sync does not cover it.\n- `perch-pull` failed twice on 9/26–9/27. The log is at `~/DEV/PlayerProfiles_FB_03-28-2026/logs/last_run.json`. I did not look at it.\n- `RunningTheRoom` is missing from the backup manifest. The memory compiler is behind by a few logs.\n\n**What I did**\n- DEV root: `/Users/kristinarash/DEV`.\n- Config and skills: all three repos pulled and pushed. Memory moved: 15 new commits came from Windows. The newest is \"closeout 2026-09-26: Flint memory thread…\".\n- Memory mirror: 3 files copied, 1 replaced by a newer Mac copy, 1 MEMORY.md merged. I committed and pushed it.\n- Repos checked: 145. Pulled: 9 (KeystoneOS, LibraryProject, PP_Recruiting, RTP_Constraints_Course, RunningTheRoom, skill-audit, SportScienceResearchRepo, TypeSafe_Sandbox, MatchupAnalysis_FB2026).\n- Committed: `graphify-out` had 13 changed nightly graph files. I committed and pushed them.\n- Cloned: `Flint` and `AI_Analyst`. They were on GitHub but not on this Mac.\n- Created: none.\n- Router: I added Flint to `RESEARCH.md`, but Windows had already added it. I kept the Windows line. No `.from-*` files were made.\n- Activity: 26 repos are active. The other 115 dormant repos are all clean.\n\n**Result: clean.** Nothing is dirty or unpushed.\n\n---\n\n```\nPicking up: TypeSafe_Sandbox (newest active repo)\nLast session: 2026-09-26 (machine not recorded)\nWhere things stand: Drive triage test is set up but not run. Can Jev sort the 3,548 Drive files that Flint's rules miss? The pass bars are approved.\nBlocked on: Is the Mac API key good? Run smoke_test.py. Also: go to maintenance mode, or keep testing?\nNext: Build Claude's blind answer key before the first Jev call. Mac: copy the permission-gate shadow hook.\n```\n\nNote: Flint is newer (9/27), but it is not on the active list yet.\n\n**What now:** Say which repo you want to work on. My pick is TypeSafe, or Flint if the Drive triage is for Flint."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":98928,"output_tokens":1209,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":264},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1209,"cache_read_input_tokens":98928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfVtQC2LGV2MsawvNUFvg","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f6b4e6f-6678-4e42-a3af-9cc194182dfa","timestamp":"2026-09-28T13:06:18.309Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"02d4a48c-336d-4ffa-a0f7-cc20fd6681c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"02d4a48c-336d-4ffa-a0f7-cc20fd6681c5","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"main"}
